    {
      "id": "12419_kisei_ex3",
      "japanese": "{今年|ことし}のゴールデンウィークは{久|ひさ}しぶりに{帰省|きせい}して、{実家|じっか}で{家族|かぞく}とゆっくり{過|す}ごした。",
      "english": "This Golden Week, I went back to my hometown for the first time in a while and spent a relaxed time with my family at my parents' house.",
